W:De Camptown ladies sing dis song, Doo-dah! doo-dah!
W:De Camptown race-track five miles long, Oh, doo-dah day!
W:I come down dah wid my hat caved in, Doo-dah! doo-dah!
W:I go back home wid a pocket full of tin, Oh, doo-dah day!
W:
W:Gwine to run all night!
W:Gwine to run all day!
W:I’ll bet my money on de bob-tail nag,
W:Somebody bet on de bay.
